WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.560
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.560 --> 00:06.150
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.820 --> 00:10.220
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.920 --> 00:14.930
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.300 --> 00:17.830
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.170 --> 00:21.610
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.360 --> 00:28.580
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.260 --> 00:34.340
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.140 --> 00:37.630
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.630 --> 00:40.240
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.760 --> 00:48.020
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.990 --> 00:51.750
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.810 --> 00:54.650
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.940 --> 00:55.970
♪Let me♪

00:56.160 --> 01:00.240
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.690 --> 01:03.370
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.660 --> 01:06.360
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.530 --> 01:08.000
♪Hands held tight♪

01:08.000 --> 01:12.170
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.530 --> 01:22.780
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.210 --> 01:29.760
=Legend of The Female General=

01:30.300 --> 01:30.940
That's all

01:31.300 --> 01:32.580
for today.

01:33.060 --> 01:34.100
Remember

01:34.660 --> 01:36.340
to review what you've learned.

01:37.140 --> 01:37.820
Tomorrow,

01:38.060 --> 01:40.380
I will personally test you.

01:43.580 --> 01:44.220
Understood.

01:48.660 --> 01:50.420
He always wears a mask.

01:51.020 --> 01:52.220
What's wrong with him?

01:54.140 --> 01:54.700
You'll know.

01:57.370 --> 01:58.020
(Huainanzi)

01:58.979 --> 01:59.740
Give it back!

01:59.860 --> 02:00.740
Come take it back.

02:01.420 --> 02:02.100
Come on!

02:02.860 --> 02:03.540
Come get it.

02:03.980 --> 02:04.500
Come on.

02:04.780 --> 02:05.320
Come on.

02:05.500 --> 02:06.500
You can't get it.

02:09.419 --> 02:10.419
You can't get it.

02:12.260 --> 02:12.900
Give it back!

02:14.740 --> 02:15.340
Give it back!

02:21.940 --> 02:22.470
Let's go.

02:25.740 --> 02:26.260
Thanks.

02:26.740 --> 02:27.500
Short and dumb.

02:28.140 --> 02:28.660
I wonder

02:28.660 --> 02:29.780
how you got in.

02:30.620 --> 02:31.740
You eat more at night.

02:35.780 --> 02:36.660
Xianchang Academy

02:36.660 --> 02:37.780
doesn't select me by height.

02:38.660 --> 02:39.220
Besides,

02:39.780 --> 02:40.420
I'm not dumb.

02:50.490 --> 02:53.480
=Episode 3=

04:09.740 --> 04:10.860
Bye, Commander Xiao.

04:12.020 --> 04:12.700
It's you again.

04:13.830 --> 04:15.730
(Xiao)

04:56.140 --> 04:57.100
He's doing great today.

04:57.460 --> 04:58.380
He doesn't lag behind.

04:59.340 --> 05:00.700
When fighting me yesterday,

05:01.340 --> 05:02.860
he wasn't weak at all.

05:03.700 --> 05:04.940
So, he's been pretending.

05:05.740 --> 05:07.260
Seems we need a more enticing bait.

05:07.860 --> 05:08.940
Let's see

05:08.940 --> 05:10.460
when his true colors emerge.

05:11.300 --> 05:12.340
Since you've doubted

05:12.340 --> 05:13.500
He Yan's identity,

05:13.900 --> 05:15.020
why stay quiet?

05:15.860 --> 05:17.180
When fighting him,

05:17.820 --> 05:19.780
I sensed his physical weakness,

05:20.220 --> 05:22.060
yet his moves flowed effortlessly.

05:22.700 --> 05:24.180
Clearly, he's not an amateur.

05:25.100 --> 05:26.380
He's slippery.

05:27.220 --> 05:28.260
Without solid evidence,

05:28.260 --> 05:29.300
he won't confess.

05:30.300 --> 05:31.220
Our task

05:31.940 --> 05:33.940
is to expose his flaws openly.

05:39.220 --> 05:39.780
Shen Han.

05:41.460 --> 05:42.580
Do something for me.

05:44.700 --> 05:45.290
Yes.

05:48.340 --> 05:49.380
- Let me help you.
- Move.

05:49.380 --> 05:50.060
Come on!

06:12.220 --> 06:13.320
(Jiuqi Camp)

06:37.380 --> 06:38.300
So impressive!

06:47.940 --> 06:48.740
If I could

06:49.020 --> 06:49.860
be as brave as them,

06:49.860 --> 06:50.570
that'd be great.

06:50.780 --> 06:51.900
Who are they?

06:52.100 --> 06:53.020
Why so valiant?

06:53.420 --> 06:54.140
Jiuqi Camp.

06:54.740 --> 06:55.780
Jiuqi Camp?

06:56.380 --> 06:57.540
What's that?

06:57.780 --> 06:58.700
You don't know?

06:58.900 --> 07:00.180
It was founded by Marshal Xiao.

07:00.860 --> 07:02.100
It accepts elite warriors only.

07:02.540 --> 07:03.580
All in black armor.

07:04.100 --> 07:05.380
They're invincible,

07:05.700 --> 07:06.900
the core force of Xiao Army.

07:07.180 --> 07:08.140
All enemies fear them.

07:08.540 --> 07:09.300
Why's everyone

07:09.740 --> 07:10.980
suddenly talking about them?

07:11.340 --> 07:12.060
Someone

07:12.060 --> 07:13.020
started it.

07:13.540 --> 07:14.220
But no one

07:14.220 --> 07:15.340
would refuse joining, right?

07:19.540 --> 07:21.020
(They're talking about Jiuqi Camp.)

07:21.980 --> 07:23.740
(Could it be planned?)

07:25.740 --> 07:27.340
(Xiao Jue noticed something)

07:27.820 --> 07:29.260
(during last night's fight.)

07:29.980 --> 07:31.300
(He set a bait)

07:31.540 --> 07:32.659
(to hook me.)

07:34.460 --> 07:35.140
(Baiting me?)

07:35.700 --> 07:36.860
(I'll play along)

07:37.060 --> 07:37.860
(and join the camp.)

07:38.580 --> 07:40.060
(I will do it honorably,)

07:40.220 --> 07:40.940
(flawlessly.)

07:41.780 --> 07:43.220
(Who's bait? Who's prey?)

07:43.460 --> 07:44.420
(Game's still on.)

07:45.180 --> 07:45.770
Mr. Shen.

07:46.420 --> 07:47.020
Mr. Shen.

07:48.060 --> 07:48.580
Zoning out?

07:50.500 --> 07:51.020
Mr. Shen.

07:53.420 --> 07:54.150
Work harder,

07:54.540 --> 07:55.740
and you can join them too.

07:56.180 --> 07:57.060
They're so formidable.

07:57.260 --> 07:58.060
I'm joining them.

08:03.340 --> 08:04.620
Don't rush to join them

08:04.620 --> 08:05.460
just because of that.

08:05.700 --> 08:07.260
They often spearhead the frontlines,

08:07.420 --> 08:08.140
where casualties

08:08.140 --> 08:09.100
remain alarmingly high.

08:09.620 --> 08:10.460
That's perfect then.

08:11.020 --> 08:12.100
They need fresh recruits.

08:12.300 --> 08:13.300
I need military merits.

08:13.740 --> 08:14.860
If I join the Jiuqi Camp,

08:15.140 --> 08:16.100
it's win-win.

08:18.300 --> 08:19.020
We do

08:19.020 --> 08:20.540
select one recruit annually.

08:20.900 --> 08:21.510
However,

08:21.820 --> 08:23.620
it must be
the most outstanding candidate.

08:24.340 --> 08:24.900
This year,

08:25.540 --> 08:26.740
save yourselves the trouble.

08:27.380 --> 08:28.460
The best candidate is

08:29.140 --> 08:29.940
right before you.

08:31.980 --> 08:32.580
Good.

08:32.900 --> 08:34.299
I'll be watching your performance.

08:41.700 --> 08:42.460
He.

08:42.460 --> 08:43.020
Come quick!

08:43.220 --> 08:44.100
Look, meat flatbreads.

08:52.940 --> 08:53.660
That flatbread

08:54.180 --> 08:54.820
is mine.

08:55.420 --> 08:56.220
Yours?

08:57.180 --> 08:57.940
Call its name

08:58.500 --> 08:59.620
and see if it answers you.

09:00.380 --> 09:01.860
Who can prove this is yours?

09:02.700 --> 09:03.500
I'm eating it.

09:03.780 --> 09:04.660
What can you do?

09:05.780 --> 09:06.940
What can I do about it?

09:11.820 --> 09:12.420
You...

09:12.500 --> 09:13.220
You...

09:14.060 --> 09:14.630
Yes.

09:15.180 --> 09:15.820
I did it.

09:16.180 --> 09:16.980
Who can verify that?

09:17.780 --> 09:18.940
What can you do about it?

09:20.060 --> 09:20.580
You...

09:21.540 --> 09:22.060
Want a fight?

09:24.900 --> 09:25.510
Fine.

09:25.980 --> 09:27.180
Wait for me after training.

09:27.180 --> 09:28.100
I'll make you pay.

09:29.060 --> 09:30.020
Enough, He.

09:30.300 --> 09:31.500
Don't stoop to his level.

09:32.140 --> 09:33.260
Since he took my food once,

09:33.900 --> 09:34.780
he might do it again.

09:35.700 --> 09:36.740
If he takes my food daily,

09:37.460 --> 09:38.300
should I starve

09:38.300 --> 09:39.060
every single day?

09:39.700 --> 09:40.220
That is

09:40.860 --> 09:42.220
so not fair.

09:42.460 --> 09:43.860
Are you talking with me

09:43.860 --> 09:45.100
about fairness?

09:46.220 --> 09:47.220
With your weakness,

09:47.420 --> 09:48.140
you won't

09:48.420 --> 09:49.700
survive a month here.

09:50.020 --> 09:50.740
Not even a month.

09:51.220 --> 09:52.060
No need to wait.

09:52.900 --> 09:53.620
In ten days,

09:54.060 --> 09:54.820
at training field,

09:55.660 --> 09:57.180
I'll defeat you in archery,

09:58.020 --> 09:59.340
your best skill.

10:03.940 --> 10:05.820
Are you crazy?

10:06.220 --> 10:08.420
You understand your own words?

10:08.780 --> 10:09.500
Which part

10:09.500 --> 10:10.540
did you not hear?

10:11.460 --> 10:12.660
Let me repeat myself.

10:13.540 --> 10:14.340
In ten days,

10:15.060 --> 10:16.460
I will defeat you.

10:17.580 --> 10:18.380
Pretty boy,

10:18.980 --> 10:20.100
you're very bold.

10:22.020 --> 10:22.540
Alright.

10:22.860 --> 10:24.100
That's a bold wager.

10:24.100 --> 10:25.300
- Yes.
- Good.

10:25.620 --> 10:26.780
If you lose,

10:27.620 --> 10:29.380
you'll become an army cook.

10:30.180 --> 10:30.790
Deal.

10:31.300 --> 10:32.500
But if you lose,

10:33.180 --> 10:34.060
you'll call me boss.

10:38.860 --> 10:39.900
Don't humiliate yourself.

10:40.740 --> 10:41.780
In ten days,

10:42.500 --> 10:44.060
I'll challenge you to a spear duel.

10:44.500 --> 10:45.500
Do you dare to accept it?

10:46.820 --> 10:48.420
Since you're so reckless,

10:48.940 --> 10:49.860
I'll play along.

10:51.900 --> 10:52.490
Good.

10:53.180 --> 10:54.300
In ten days,

10:55.020 --> 10:56.380
we'll compete.

10:56.900 --> 10:57.420
How dare you!

10:58.340 --> 10:59.700
- Commander.
- Commander.

10:59.900 --> 11:01.740
Brawling right after joining the army?

11:02.060 --> 11:03.660
Have you no respect for discipline?

11:04.500 --> 11:05.100
It's okay.

11:06.860 --> 11:08.420
He wants to join the Jiuqi Camp.

11:09.340 --> 11:10.260
I'll see

11:11.020 --> 11:12.420
if he's qualified.

11:42.930 --> 11:44.370
♪I've seen the mountains♪

11:44.560 --> 11:45.920
♪And trodden through ice♪

11:46.070 --> 11:48.600
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

11:48.900 --> 11:50.610
♪Destiny is my creed♪

11:50.760 --> 11:52.160
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

11:52.310 --> 11:54.110
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

11:55.310 --> 11:56.780
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

11:56.950 --> 11:58.230
♪Gazing through the mire♪

11:58.410 --> 12:00.800
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

12:01.000 --> 12:03.050
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

12:04.190 --> 12:06.020
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

12:07.980 --> 12:10.900
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

12:10.980 --> 12:13.650
♪There must always be a longing♪

12:14.100 --> 12:19.160
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

12:19.500 --> 12:21.510
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

12:21.820 --> 12:25.470
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

12:25.700 --> 12:27.590
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

12:27.620 --> 12:31.470
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

12:31.820 --> 12:33.760
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

12:33.950 --> 12:37.770
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

12:38.030 --> 12:43.780
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

12:44.670 --> 12:50.130
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

12:57.540 --> 12:58.420
You work so hard,

12:59.140 --> 13:00.460
yet you're still weak.

13:08.260 --> 13:10.060
The sneaky person at the bathing pool

13:11.740 --> 13:12.540
was you, right?

13:16.260 --> 13:17.060
A while ago,

13:17.220 --> 13:18.860
I was exhausted from training.

13:19.180 --> 13:20.540
So, I went to bathe to relax.

13:22.340 --> 13:24.020
The person who was bathing that night

13:24.500 --> 13:25.660
was actually you.

13:26.500 --> 13:27.380
However,

13:27.620 --> 13:29.020
I panicked and fled recklessly

13:29.300 --> 13:30.060
that night.

13:30.460 --> 13:31.820
I hope you won't blame me.

13:33.060 --> 13:34.220
You panicked?

13:34.660 --> 13:36.220
Sure, I did.

13:39.820 --> 13:40.860
You're suspicious

13:41.420 --> 13:42.380
and a liar.

13:42.940 --> 13:44.460
What's your real intention?

13:46.500 --> 13:47.720
I want a trainer.

13:48.580 --> 13:49.220
What?

13:52.380 --> 13:53.060
No offense,

13:53.540 --> 13:55.100
but please train me, Commander.

14:00.860 --> 14:01.780
What makes you think

14:02.380 --> 14:03.020
I'll train you?

14:05.420 --> 14:06.460
Otherwise, did you

14:06.940 --> 14:08.380
come out so late at night

14:08.660 --> 14:09.860
to ambush a recruit for fun?

14:11.020 --> 14:11.620
I know

14:12.180 --> 14:13.420
you're concerned about me.

14:14.020 --> 14:14.620
You think

14:14.620 --> 14:15.820
I have potential.

14:16.420 --> 14:17.500
Practice needs a partner.

14:17.740 --> 14:18.820
Practicing alone

14:19.140 --> 14:19.980
won't work out.

14:20.740 --> 14:22.660
If you train me,

14:23.020 --> 14:25.220
I'm certain I'll make great progress.

14:25.860 --> 14:27.140
Quite cheeky.

14:34.420 --> 14:35.580
If you can resist ten strikes

14:35.580 --> 14:36.380
in a circle,

14:37.420 --> 14:38.380
I'll train you.

14:41.060 --> 14:41.660
Deal.

15:43.540 --> 15:44.420
Can't even hold it.

15:44.860 --> 15:45.900
Why should I train you?

15:46.100 --> 15:46.660
I...

16:27.180 --> 16:27.820
Commander.

16:28.700 --> 16:29.660
Ten strikes done.

16:31.340 --> 16:32.020
I'm still in.

16:41.180 --> 16:42.020
My fault.

16:42.580 --> 16:43.140
Accidentally,

16:44.420 --> 16:45.580
I offended you.

16:50.260 --> 16:50.820
Commander.

16:51.380 --> 16:52.100
A promise

16:52.420 --> 16:53.180
is a promise.

16:53.500 --> 16:54.700
You can't go back on it.

16:55.340 --> 16:56.380
Breaking a promise

16:56.820 --> 16:58.060
is a disgrace.

17:05.660 --> 17:06.339
Commander.

17:11.380 --> 17:12.260
Every night, Xu hour.

17:14.740 --> 17:15.339
Thank you.

17:19.420 --> 17:20.900
Thank you, master.

17:22.780 --> 17:23.900
This is your first lesson.

17:24.740 --> 17:25.579
Remember your words.

17:25.940 --> 17:26.740
If you can't win,

17:28.460 --> 17:29.780
get out of Yezhou Garrison.

17:39.780 --> 17:41.700
Since you're using
the Jiuqi Camp as bait,

17:42.380 --> 17:43.340
I'll absolutely

17:43.340 --> 17:44.460
take this chance.

17:46.620 --> 17:48.100
I'll certainly use you

17:49.020 --> 17:50.460
to succeed.

18:05.380 --> 18:06.820
He learned quite quickly.

18:36.260 --> 18:36.860
(Commander.)

18:37.300 --> 18:38.020
(A promise)

18:38.340 --> 18:39.180
(is a promise.)

18:39.500 --> 18:40.660
(You can't go back on it.)

18:41.420 --> 18:42.300
(Breaking a promise)

18:42.860 --> 18:44.020
(is a disgrace.)

18:44.940 --> 18:46.220
I never agreed to anything.

19:03.540 --> 19:04.740
I've mastered the techniques,

19:05.300 --> 19:06.420
yet he shows no concern.

19:07.900 --> 19:08.580
It's not good.

19:08.700 --> 19:09.300
I must make him

19:09.300 --> 19:10.620
witness my progress.

19:16.900 --> 19:17.640
Commander.

19:18.300 --> 19:19.210
Are you there?

20:20.300 --> 20:21.060
Qinglang.

20:24.740 --> 20:25.660
Long time no see.

20:29.980 --> 20:31.420
(I once asked a swordsmith)

20:32.020 --> 20:33.340
to forge two swords.

20:34.020 --> 20:35.380
One is named Yinqiu.

20:35.860 --> 20:37.180
I gave that to Huaijin

20:38.100 --> 20:38.900
when he came of age.

20:39.420 --> 20:40.100
This one

20:40.220 --> 20:41.380
is named Qinglang.

20:41.900 --> 20:42.700
Today,

20:43.900 --> 20:44.700
I'll give it to you.

20:47.180 --> 20:47.880
Father.

20:48.940 --> 20:50.220
Why did you give him Qinglang?

20:51.980 --> 20:52.980
This sword is valuable.

20:53.620 --> 20:54.300
I can't take it.

20:55.780 --> 20:56.940
Constant effort

20:57.220 --> 20:58.220
brings success.

20:59.020 --> 20:59.900
Someday,

21:00.220 --> 21:01.340
you two will become

21:01.420 --> 21:02.500
the twin stars of Wei,

21:02.860 --> 21:03.820
working together.

21:04.100 --> 21:04.780
Wielding swords

21:05.140 --> 21:06.060
to defend our land

21:06.620 --> 21:07.500
and protect people.

21:09.020 --> 21:09.660
Take it.

21:13.460 --> 21:14.180
I will not

21:14.420 --> 21:15.900
betray your trust.

21:30.420 --> 21:32.020
You're unworthy of this Qinglang Sword

21:32.060 --> 21:33.380
from my father.

21:56.340 --> 21:57.620
It's quite a sharp sword.

21:57.900 --> 21:58.660
It's rare to see.

21:59.100 --> 22:00.220
So, I couldn't help

22:00.500 --> 22:01.660
touching it.

22:02.900 --> 22:03.620
Commander.

22:03.620 --> 22:04.460
You're magnanimous.

22:04.700 --> 22:05.900
You won't blame me, will you?

22:12.940 --> 22:13.940
The sword you're holding

22:14.420 --> 22:15.580
is quite great too!

22:18.940 --> 22:20.260
Why did you come to my tent?

22:21.740 --> 22:23.060
I've practiced diligently

22:23.340 --> 22:24.940
and mastered what you taught me.

22:25.260 --> 22:26.780
Aren't you going to check on me?

22:28.180 --> 22:28.980
I'm busy.

22:31.620 --> 22:32.200
Come.

22:33.620 --> 22:34.380
I knew

22:34.460 --> 22:35.540
you were responsible.

22:50.380 --> 22:51.140
Bet on Wang Ba.

22:51.140 --> 22:52.100
Quick! Tell me!

22:52.140 --> 22:52.980
Who to bet on?

22:53.500 --> 22:54.180
On Wang Ba.

22:54.180 --> 22:55.420
- On Wang Ba.
- Me too.

22:55.780 --> 22:56.300
And you?

22:56.660 --> 22:57.300
Jiang Jiao.

22:57.300 --> 22:58.700
Jiang Jiao? Two on Jiang Jiao?

22:58.980 --> 22:59.740
(Jiang Jiao, He Yan, Wang Ba)
Three flatbreads?

22:59.740 --> 23:00.580
I'm all in!

23:00.780 --> 23:01.620
My bet's on Wang Ba.

23:01.740 --> 23:02.540
Great!

23:02.540 --> 23:03.220
- Wang Ba!
- One!

23:03.420 --> 23:04.380
- On Jiang Jiao?
- Six!

23:04.540 --> 23:05.780
- Jiang Jiao!
- Jiang Jiao!

23:05.940 --> 23:06.500
(Wang Ba)
Five on Jiang.

23:07.020 --> 23:08.700
Who's got flatbreads left?

23:08.940 --> 23:09.940
Six on Wang Ba.

23:11.220 --> 23:12.140
- And you?
- Jiang Jiao!

23:12.420 --> 23:13.340
You note it all down?

23:13.780 --> 23:14.540
(He Yan)
Of course.

23:15.820 --> 23:16.700
(Someone actually bet)

23:16.700 --> 23:17.860
(on He Yan earlier than me.)

23:18.420 --> 23:19.050
Guys!

23:19.380 --> 23:20.060
Listen,

23:20.420 --> 23:21.260
I am

23:21.660 --> 23:22.540
betting ten flatbreads

23:23.340 --> 23:24.330
(Jiang Jiao, He Yan, Wang Ba)
on He Yan.

23:24.460 --> 23:25.180
- What?
- Sir.

23:25.940 --> 23:26.980
Are you sure?

23:27.140 --> 23:27.660
Absolutely!

23:28.300 --> 23:29.820
Very impressive, Mr. Cheng.

23:30.220 --> 23:31.940
He's never short on flatbreads.

23:32.740 --> 23:34.020
Place your bets! Quickly!

23:35.180 --> 23:35.860
Wang Ba!

23:36.060 --> 23:37.660
- Wang Ba!
- Go!

23:37.660 --> 23:38.340
Wang Ba, come on!

23:38.500 --> 23:39.340
Wang Ba, come on!

23:39.380 --> 23:40.140
You'll win.

23:40.220 --> 23:41.700
- You'll win.
- Wang Ba will win!

23:43.980 --> 23:44.660
- He!
- Wang Ba!

23:44.700 --> 23:45.540
Go for it!

23:45.940 --> 23:46.700
Show your skills!

23:46.980 --> 23:47.900
Go, Wang Ba!

23:47.980 --> 23:49.660
Wang Ba!

23:49.780 --> 23:51.220
Wang Ba, come on!

23:51.220 --> 23:51.980
Wang Ba, come on!

23:51.980 --> 23:52.660
Wang Ba!

23:52.660 --> 23:53.460
Show your skills!

23:53.460 --> 23:54.100
You'll win!

23:54.140 --> 23:55.020
Wang Ba!

23:55.020 --> 23:55.700
Go for it, He!

23:55.820 --> 23:57.980
Wang Ba!

23:57.980 --> 23:59.100
Go for it, He!

23:59.300 --> 24:00.300
He!

24:00.420 --> 24:01.340
Wang Ba!

24:01.340 --> 24:02.220
Go for it, He!

24:02.220 --> 24:02.860
You'll win!

24:02.980 --> 24:03.500
Lei Hou.

24:03.980 --> 24:04.580
You bet on me?

24:05.020 --> 24:05.940
I didn't bet on anyone.

24:06.900 --> 24:07.420
Hey.

24:08.060 --> 24:09.340
Change your mind now,

24:09.340 --> 24:10.620
or you'll humiliate yourself.

24:11.740 --> 24:12.300
Exactly!

24:12.620 --> 24:13.220
Give it up!

24:16.330 --> 24:16.840
So funny.

24:17.260 --> 24:18.580
I was about to say the same.

24:19.620 --> 24:20.580
You'll regret it.

24:21.580 --> 24:24.260
Wang Ba!

24:24.500 --> 24:25.060
You'll win!

24:25.140 --> 24:26.420
Wang Ba, come on!

24:26.420 --> 24:27.220
You'll win!

24:27.260 --> 24:28.580
Wang Ba, come on!

24:30.900 --> 24:32.460
Wang Ba, come on!

24:39.260 --> 24:40.380
Wang Ba won!

24:44.700 --> 24:45.500
Impressive!

24:46.260 --> 24:47.100
Wang Ba won.

24:50.100 --> 24:52.180
Awesome!

24:52.300 --> 24:53.380
Wang Ba won!

24:53.980 --> 24:54.540
Impressive.

24:56.060 --> 24:56.820
Give it up!

25:01.020 --> 25:01.780
Give it up!

25:06.100 --> 25:06.980
Give it up!

25:08.140 --> 25:09.100
- Give it up!
- Be quiet!

25:12.180 --> 25:13.380
You're humiliating yourself.

25:13.420 --> 25:14.260
Exactly.

25:14.260 --> 25:15.180
Indeed.

25:15.180 --> 25:15.980
Give it up!

25:15.980 --> 25:16.900
Give it up!

25:17.940 --> 25:18.980
Look at him.

25:19.060 --> 25:20.380
I knew it.

25:20.620 --> 25:21.580
He's bound to lose.

25:21.860 --> 25:22.780
Give it up!

25:28.900 --> 25:29.820
Give it up!

25:37.140 --> 25:38.060
Give it up!

25:40.140 --> 25:40.860
Get out of here.

25:55.260 --> 25:55.910
Well...

25:56.780 --> 25:57.700
Pierced right through!

25:58.380 --> 25:59.500
Quite strong.

25:59.500 --> 26:00.300
Is he that skilled?

26:01.100 --> 26:02.380
- Well...
- Precise and powerful.

26:02.420 --> 26:03.660
He's pretty strong.

26:06.300 --> 26:07.340
Congrats!

26:07.820 --> 26:08.860
Among these recruits,

26:09.020 --> 26:10.660
you've got a capable heroine.

26:10.740 --> 26:11.430
No,

26:11.900 --> 26:12.660
a capable hero.

26:13.820 --> 26:14.980
Both Wang Ba and He Yan

26:15.180 --> 26:16.060
are doing great.

26:16.300 --> 26:17.740
Credit goes to Mr. Shen.

26:18.020 --> 26:18.900
Not really, Mr. Cheng.

26:19.140 --> 26:20.300
I can't claim the credit.

26:20.620 --> 26:21.300
Commander Xiao's

26:21.460 --> 26:22.460
training methods work.

26:22.940 --> 26:23.980
My discerning eyes

26:24.220 --> 26:25.340
never misjudge talent.

26:26.700 --> 26:27.820
Remember our wager?

26:28.300 --> 26:29.340
No backing out.

26:31.580 --> 26:32.100
Mr. Shen.

26:32.380 --> 26:33.060
Who's your pick?

26:33.820 --> 26:34.700
Wang Ba

26:35.060 --> 26:35.740
has potential.

26:36.220 --> 26:37.060
He was a bandit

26:37.180 --> 26:37.900
and a rebel.

26:38.180 --> 26:38.820
But he's good

26:39.020 --> 26:40.140
at archery.

26:40.700 --> 26:41.460
He Yan

26:41.860 --> 26:42.620
works hard.

26:42.660 --> 26:43.540
He's mild-tempered.

26:44.380 --> 26:45.420
A few years later,

26:45.740 --> 26:46.620
he'll become

26:46.660 --> 26:48.060
the best of the recruits.

26:48.060 --> 26:49.260
You've misjudged, Mr. Shen.

26:50.460 --> 26:51.380
The rebellious one

26:51.500 --> 26:52.420
isn't Wang Ba.

26:55.020 --> 26:56.060
But He Yan

26:57.620 --> 26:58.940
is getting more interesting.

27:02.100 --> 27:02.860
After your rest,

27:03.220 --> 27:04.220
- let's...
- I'm rested.

27:04.980 --> 27:05.820
Let's begin.

27:07.780 --> 27:11.740
- Go!
- You can do it!

27:11.860 --> 27:13.420
- Jiang Jiao, go for it!
- Go!

27:13.500 --> 27:14.420
Go for it!

27:15.860 --> 27:17.180
- Come on!
- You can do it!

27:21.140 --> 27:21.670
Good!

27:22.340 --> 27:23.540
Excellent!

27:24.100 --> 27:24.620
Keep going!

27:25.180 --> 27:25.820
Go for it!

27:27.820 --> 27:28.860
Amazing!

27:29.620 --> 27:30.150
Go for it!

27:44.820 --> 27:46.500
Bravo!

27:46.980 --> 27:47.500
Splendid!

27:49.180 --> 27:49.780
Who won?

27:50.140 --> 27:50.980
(Given his strength,)

27:51.180 --> 27:52.620
(is he actually a recruit?)

27:55.940 --> 27:56.460
Why

27:56.460 --> 27:57.380
is He just defending?

28:00.300 --> 28:01.140
Faster! Quicker!

28:01.140 --> 28:02.460
One more strike to beat him!

28:16.540 --> 28:17.380
(He's testing me.)

28:18.140 --> 28:19.140
That dodge

28:19.140 --> 28:19.940
was so good.

28:21.740 --> 28:22.280
Commander.

28:22.980 --> 28:24.420
He Yan's evasive maneuver is

28:24.420 --> 28:24.940
like yours.

28:29.060 --> 28:29.820
Yet he failed

28:29.860 --> 28:30.900
to dodge your stone?

28:31.460 --> 28:32.740
He chose not to dodge.

28:35.340 --> 28:35.900
(No weapons)

28:36.140 --> 28:36.680
(can defeat)

28:36.940 --> 28:37.580
(spears.)

28:49.780 --> 28:51.300
He Yan!

28:51.380 --> 28:52.700
Few people are skilled at spear.

28:53.060 --> 28:53.860
But once they do,

28:54.260 --> 28:54.980
they will not

28:55.420 --> 28:56.500
fear all other weapons.

28:56.940 --> 28:57.540
Well done!

28:58.020 --> 29:00.340
This Jiang Jiao is useless.

29:00.740 --> 29:01.380
Unbelievable.

29:04.060 --> 29:04.620
Pretty boy.

29:06.860 --> 29:07.460
What?

29:11.020 --> 29:11.660
A bet's a bet.

29:13.380 --> 29:13.990
Boss.

29:16.100 --> 29:17.060
Oh, right.

29:17.500 --> 29:19.100
I almost forgot.

29:23.620 --> 29:24.580
There's someone else

29:25.540 --> 29:26.700
who needs to call me boss.

29:32.860 --> 29:33.380
Wang Ba.

29:33.900 --> 29:34.700
It's your turn.

29:35.260 --> 29:36.860
You're not trying to back out, are you?

29:44.860 --> 29:45.980
Move aside!

29:52.300 --> 29:53.820
B-Bo...

29:53.980 --> 29:54.660
You can...

29:54.660 --> 29:55.700
Boss.

30:00.100 --> 30:01.020
You heard me.

30:01.660 --> 30:02.260
Sure, I did.

30:02.820 --> 30:03.700
I just never expected

30:03.940 --> 30:04.780
you'd actually do it.

30:05.820 --> 30:08.500
As a real man...

30:09.180 --> 30:10.220
That's it.

30:11.420 --> 30:12.100
I did it.

30:12.100 --> 30:12.620
Stop looking!

30:12.660 --> 30:13.460
Get out of here!

30:13.620 --> 30:15.460
Get out of here!

30:17.940 --> 30:19.020
Let's go.

30:19.100 --> 30:20.300
- Get out of here.
- Go.

30:20.620 --> 30:21.580
Let's train harder.

30:21.700 --> 30:22.500
I lost the bet,

30:22.860 --> 30:24.300
but I watched a good match.

30:24.380 --> 30:25.100
Sure.

30:25.100 --> 30:25.620
Let's go.

30:26.300 --> 30:27.020
Commander.

30:28.940 --> 30:29.460
Commander.

30:30.940 --> 30:31.580
You forgot this.

30:35.580 --> 30:36.220
You did well.

30:36.980 --> 30:37.580
Keep it.

30:40.060 --> 30:41.380
I'll remember

30:41.620 --> 30:43.020
your kindness forever.

30:52.420 --> 30:53.020
Coming!

30:53.340 --> 30:53.960
Flatbreads.

30:55.860 --> 30:56.580
Guys! Listen up!

30:57.180 --> 30:58.220
Thanks to Mr. He,

30:58.540 --> 31:00.140
I won the bet

31:00.460 --> 31:01.340
in today's match.

31:01.500 --> 31:02.060
Tonight,

31:02.260 --> 31:02.860
it's my treat.

31:03.020 --> 31:04.180
Just help yourselves.

31:04.420 --> 31:05.700
What are you waiting for?

31:06.860 --> 31:07.660
All of us

31:08.220 --> 31:09.540
should thank Mr. Cheng.

31:10.060 --> 31:11.100
Thank you, Mr. Cheng.

31:11.660 --> 31:13.060
Thank you, Mr. Cheng.

31:13.740 --> 31:14.780
Let's eat!

31:15.700 --> 31:16.820
Let's eat!

31:17.900 --> 31:18.580
Smells good!

31:20.420 --> 31:20.940
I know

31:21.180 --> 31:22.540
I am good-looking.

31:22.860 --> 31:23.540
However,

31:23.540 --> 31:24.860
you staring so boldly at me

31:25.380 --> 31:26.340
is making me

31:26.660 --> 31:27.700
feel rather uncomfortable.

31:28.980 --> 31:29.660
Mr. Cheng.

31:29.660 --> 31:30.740
You're overthinking.

31:31.260 --> 31:32.220
I doubt

31:32.460 --> 31:33.460
the flatbreads you won

31:33.620 --> 31:34.460
are enough for us.

31:34.700 --> 31:36.020
This is my way of repaying you.

31:37.260 --> 31:38.900
You may lose more than you gain.

31:39.220 --> 31:39.980
It's worth it.

31:41.460 --> 31:42.700
Bring the soup if it's ready.

31:44.100 --> 31:46.180
Great!

31:47.180 --> 31:48.020
Smells so good.

31:49.140 --> 31:51.100
Smells so good.

31:51.100 --> 31:52.660
Exactly! Where are the bowls?

31:52.700 --> 31:54.180
- Give me a bowl.
- Thanks, Mr. Cheng!

31:54.500 --> 31:55.380
The soup is served.

31:55.900 --> 31:57.300
Your title as Yezhou's top warrior

31:57.660 --> 31:58.540
might be in jeopardy.

31:59.260 --> 31:59.860
Mr. He

32:00.060 --> 32:01.580
has trained hard this month.

32:01.780 --> 32:03.380
That's why he shocked everyone today.

32:03.660 --> 32:04.220
Both of us

32:04.700 --> 32:05.620
stop being jealous.

32:07.620 --> 32:08.260
Mr. He.

32:10.180 --> 32:10.780
Congrats!

32:12.260 --> 32:12.980
Thanks, Mr. Lei.

32:19.140 --> 32:19.750
Commander.

32:19.940 --> 32:20.940
At the training field,

32:21.140 --> 32:21.900
you said

32:22.140 --> 32:23.740
he chose not to dodge.
What did you mean?

32:24.540 --> 32:25.820
I used the Jiuqi Camp as bait

32:26.420 --> 32:27.620
to lure him to duel.

32:28.220 --> 32:29.460
While he was overwhelmed,

32:29.580 --> 32:30.380
I secretly acted

32:31.380 --> 32:33.180
to force him to reveal some flaw.

32:34.180 --> 32:34.860
Unexpectedly,

32:36.100 --> 32:36.860
he actually

32:36.940 --> 32:38.020
discerned my intention.

32:38.580 --> 32:39.620
So, he didn't dodge.

32:43.380 --> 32:44.380
He's not only resilient,

32:44.820 --> 32:45.540
but also clever.

32:47.180 --> 32:48.740
He's a formidable opponent.

32:49.020 --> 32:50.020
Anyway,

32:50.700 --> 32:51.260
He Yan

32:51.260 --> 32:52.420
is definitely up to no good.

32:53.220 --> 32:54.460
Shall I go arrest him first?

32:54.940 --> 32:55.540
No rush.

32:56.820 --> 32:57.980
So, you already have a plan?

32:58.620 --> 32:59.420
These new recruits

32:59.900 --> 33:00.900
have been training

33:00.940 --> 33:01.660
for a full month.

33:02.660 --> 33:04.340
It's time for their competition.

33:05.500 --> 33:06.180
Then

33:07.140 --> 33:08.340
the truth will reveal itself.

33:09.470 --> 33:11.620
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

33:11.730 --> 33:15.650
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

33:15.820 --> 33:17.770
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

33:17.860 --> 33:22.790
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

33:34.890 --> 33:36.290
♪I've seen the mountains♪

33:36.490 --> 33:37.910
♪And trodden through ice♪

33:38.180 --> 33:40.990
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

33:41.300 --> 33:42.690
♪Destiny is my creed♪

33:42.750 --> 33:44.150
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

33:44.290 --> 33:46.090
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

33:47.290 --> 33:48.760
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

33:48.930 --> 33:50.220
♪Gazing through the mire♪

33:50.390 --> 33:52.790
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

33:52.980 --> 33:55.030
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

33:56.170 --> 33:58.000
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

33:59.960 --> 34:02.880
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

34:02.970 --> 34:05.630
♪There must always be a longing♪

34:06.080 --> 34:11.150
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

34:11.480 --> 34:13.489
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

34:13.800 --> 34:17.449
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

34:17.690 --> 34:19.580
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

34:19.610 --> 34:23.460
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

34:23.810 --> 34:25.750
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

34:25.929 --> 34:29.750
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

34:30.010 --> 34:35.760
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

34:36.650 --> 34:42.120
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

